### ============================================================
###  Tenant Owner API — /api/tenants/{id}/*
###  Caller must be a tenant OWNER for add-member and leave.
###  Any tenant member can read the license.
###  Run auth.http first to populate {{access_token}}.
### ============================================================

### Get active license + current usage vs. limits
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/license
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Add a member to the tenant (OWNER only)
###   The user must have signed in at least once (JIT provisioning).
###   Replace the subject with the user's Keycloak subject UUID.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "subject": "REPLACE_WITH_KEYCLOAK_SUBJECT_UUID",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### Add a member as OWNER role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "subject": "REPLACE_WITH_KEYCLOAK_SUBJECT_UUID",
  "role": "OWNER"
}

### Leave the current tenant (any member — but refuses if you're the last OWNER)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/membership/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ── License limit demo ──────────────────────────────────────
###  The dev seed gives alice a FREE plan (5 users / 3 projects).
###  Add 5 members then try a 6th to see the 402 response.

### 402 — add a 6th member when FREE plan allows 5
###   (Run addMember 5 times first, then this one returns 402)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "REPLACE_WITH_6TH_USER_SUBJECT",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 403 — URL tenant doesn't match JWT tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/license
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json
